{
  "slug": "viral-launch-pipeline",
  "name": "Viral Launch Pipeline",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A 21-agent orchestrator for viral product launches. One skill coordinates parallel web research (YouTube, X, Reddit, industry), manager-critiqued hook and giveaway writing, a body specialist chain (weapons, controversy, technical, flow), a Mom Test for mass-market readability, and multi-channel delivery (X-thread, LinkedIn post, ProductHunt copy). Manager loops force rewrites until the rubric passes, with a full paper trail and resumable state.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `viral-launch` (Run the full 21-agent viral launch pipeline for a product, founder announcement, or feature drop).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install viral-launch-pipeline@claude-community` from `Koz-TV/viral-launch-pipeline`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that replicates the 21-agent viral product launch pipeline used by some of the largest X launches. One orchestrator skill (`viral-launch`) coordinates 21 specialized subagents — research, hook writing, manager critique, weapons/controversy/technical/flow specialists, Mom Test, multi-channel delivery — to produce an X-thread + LinkedIn post + ProductHunt copy from a single user prompt.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
